---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Full Strategy Report
description: The complete Innovation & Earned Revenue capital strategy — who RRFB is, why now, the operating portfolio, vetting process, proof points, roadmap, and where help is needed.
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Strategy
  order: 2
---

<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom: 2.5rem;">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <p class="eyebrow hero__kicker">{{ strategy.hero.kicker }}</p>
    <h1>{{ strategy.hero.title }}</h1>
    <p class="hero__subtitle">{{ strategy.hero.subtitle }}</p>
    <div class="chip-row">
      <span class="chip chip--live">{{ strategy.hero.distribution }}</span>
      <span class="chip">{{ strategy.hero.issued }}</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="toc" aria-label="Report sections">
      <a href="#who-we-are">Who is RRFB</a>
      <a href="#why-now">Why now</a>
      <a href="#portfolio">Operating portfolio</a>
      <a href="#vetting">Vetting process</a>
      <a href="#proof-points">Proof points</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="#help">Where we need help</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" id="who-we-are">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.whoWeAre.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.whoWeAre.headline }}</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;"><strong>{{ strategy.whoWeAre.mission }}</strong></p>
    </div>
    <ul style="max-width:44rem; padding-left:1.2rem; display:grid; gap:0.6rem;">
      {% for fact in strategy.whoWeAre.facts %}
      <li>{{ fact }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="leads-box" style="margin-top:2rem; max-width:44rem; background:#17223b; border-color:#17223b; color:#f5f1e8;">
      <strong>{{ strategy.whoWeAre.coreIdea }}</strong>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1.25rem; font-size:0.85rem;">Service areas: {{ strategy.whoWeAre.serviceAreas | join(" · ") }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="why-now">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.whyNow.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.whyNow.headline }}</h2>
      <p class="muted">{{ strategy.whyNow.sub }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reason-grid">
      {% for r in strategy.whyNow.reasons %}
      <div class="reason-card">
        <div class="reason-card__number">{{ r.number }}</div>
        <h3>{{ r.title }}</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.92rem;">{{ r.body }}</p>
        <div class="reason-card__stat">{{ r.stat }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="closing-banner" style="padding-block: 2.5rem 0; background:none;">
      {% for line in strategy.whyNow.closing %}
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem; margin:0.2rem 0;"><strong>{{ line }}</strong></p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" id="portfolio">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.portfolio.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.portfolio.headline }}</h2>
      <p class="muted">{{ strategy.portfolio.sub }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="portfolio-grid">
      {% for item in strategy.portfolio.items %}
      <div class="portfolio-card">
        <div class="portfolio-card__kind">{{ item.kind }}</div>
        <h3>{{ item.name }}</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.92rem;">{{ item.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.78rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">{{ strategy.portfolio.source }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="vetting">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.vetting.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.vetting.headline }}</h2>
      <p class="muted">{{ strategy.vetting.sub }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="criteria-grid">
      {% for c in strategy.vetting.criteria %}
      <div class="criteria-card">
        <div class="criteria-card__number">{{ c.number }}</div>
        <h3>{{ c.name }}</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.88rem;">{{ c.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="stat-block" style="margin-top:2.5rem; align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <h3>What moves forward</h3>
        <ul class="muted" style="padding-left:1.2rem; display:grid; gap:0.5rem; font-size:0.92rem;">
          {% for s in strategy.vetting.selected %}
          <li>{{ s }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Near-term portfolio decisions</h3>
        <ul class="decision-list">
          {% for d in strategy.vetting.decisions %}
          <li>
            <span class="decision-status {% if 'now' in d.status | lower %}decision-status--now{% endif %}">{{ d.status }}</span>
            <span>{{ d.item }}</span>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="leads-box" style="margin-top:2rem; text-align:center;">
      <strong>{{ strategy.vetting.rule }}</strong>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.78rem; margin-top:1rem;">{{ strategy.vetting.source }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" id="proof-points">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.proofPoints.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.proofPoints.headline }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-grid">
      {% for p in strategy.proofPoints.items %}
      <div class="proof-card">
        <div class="reason-card__number" style="color:#d6273c;">{{ p.number }}</div>
        <div class="proof-card__value">{{ p.value }}</div>
        <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">{{ p.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.78rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">{{ strategy.proofPoints.source }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="roadmap">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.roadmap.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.roadmap.headline }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      {% for s in strategy.roadmap.stages %}
      <div class="timeline-card">
        <div class="timeline-card__label">{{ s.label }}</div>
        <h3 class="timeline-card__name">{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <div class="timeline-card__value">{{ s.value }}</div>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.88rem; margin-top:0.75rem;">{{ s.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem; font-size:1.1rem;"><strong>{{ strategy.roadmap.closing }}</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" id="help">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ strategy.help.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ strategy.help.headline }}</h2>
      <p class="muted">{{ strategy.help.sub }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="help-grid">
      {% for col in strategy.help.columns %}
      <div class="help-column">
        <h3>{{ col.title }}</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.88rem;">{{ col.description }}</p>
        {% for item in col.items %}
        <div class="help-column__item">
          <h4>{{ item.title }}</h4>
          <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="leads-box" style="margin-top:2rem; text-align:center; background:#17223b; border-color:#17223b; color:#f5f1e8;">
      <strong>{{ strategy.help.closing }}</strong>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="closing-banner">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="author-card" style="margin-inline:auto; max-width:34rem; text-align:left;">
      <div class="author-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div>
        <strong>{{ strategy.author.name }}</strong>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:0.2rem 0 0; font-size:0.9rem;">{{ strategy.author.title }}</p>
        <p style="margin:0.4rem 0 0; font-size:0.9rem;"><a href="mailto:{{ strategy.author.email }}" style="color:#e8b23c;">{{ strategy.author.email }}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:0.8rem;">{{ strategy.author.distribution }} &middot; {{ strategy.author.issued }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
